at is the population of the UK? The answer is 68.35 million - if you give the options 68.34 million and 68.35 million, a person who knows it is roughly 68 million still won't know which to pick.</em></li>\n<li>Make sure you give more than one possible answer - if the other options are silly, it will be too easy.<br><em>e.g. What is the biggest mammal? The answer is a blue whale - if you give mouse, hedgehog and otter as your other options, it will be really obvious what the answer is.</em></li>\n</ol>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "odZe45AjmGRe0_GbqSlwX", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 486088376, "text": "A handwritten quiz question: \"1. What is the hottest planet in the solar system? a) Mercury, b) Venus, c) Earth, d) Jupiter\"", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "1731334317868_null", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "Mask group - 2024-12-18T103926.288-ZttA9cmFlZ2ZuxY1dPhsV.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 486088336, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": nul